{"title":"2023 IOQM/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_IOQM/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91da1e3305e437df83f9533816d75ca07fb85a22.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = \\{ (a, b, c, d, e) : 0 &lt; a &lt; b &lt; c &lt; d &lt; e &lt; 100 \\}\\]\" width=\"383\" height=\"18\" />\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/c/00cbe98d2864aae78c25b55b49ae5482c8a50e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, d, e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> are integers. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Average\" title=\"Average\">average</a> value of the fourth element of\nsuch a tuple in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a>, taken over all the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Elements\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elements\">elements</a> of S, find the largest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> less\nthan or equal to D.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034855\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 578/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25492:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034855 and revision id 199889. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}